title: "presidio-hardened-ikigov-assess: assessment tool for the IKI-Gov reference model"
abstract: >-
  Command-line tool that operationalises the IKI-Gov reference model
  (Integrated KI-Governance Reference Model) for assessing AI use cases, with
  ISO/IEC 42001 and EU AI Act gap mappings.
